@startuml abrirModulos-diseño
title Diagrama de Secuencia - Abrir Modulos

actor "Admin" as Actor
participant "Vista (React)" as Vista
participant "API (FastAPI)" as API
participant "ModuloRepository" as Repo
database "Base de Datos" as DB

Actor -> Vista: solicita abrir los módulos del Programa
activate Vista
Vista -> API: GET /api/v1/programas/{programa_id}/modulos
activate API
API -> Repo: listar_del_programa(programa_id)
activate Repo
Repo -> DB: SELECT ... FROM modulos WHERE programa_id = :p ORDER BY codigo
Repo --> API: List[Modulo]
API -> Repo: contar_materias_por_modulo(programa_id)
Repo -> DB: SELECT modulo_id, COUNT(id) FROM materias\nWHERE programa_id = :p AND modulo_id IS NOT NULL GROUP BY modulo_id
Repo --> API: dict[id, n]
deactivate Repo
API --> Vista: 200 OK (List[ModuloResponse] con num_materias)
deactivate API
Vista --> Actor: presenta los módulos
deactivate Vista

@enduml
